{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le16ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Hey, Bill. What brings you here so late?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: I was out with some friends having some very boring conversation with them, so I thought I'd come here and have some interesting conversation with you instead.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: I don't know if I have anything terribly thought provoking to tell you Bill. Why was your discussion with your friends so especially dull?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: My friends like to talk about all their possessions, whereas I prefer talking about experiences. Listening to them was utterly uncompelling.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>:  No one wanted to talk about your trip to the Maldives?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: Nah!  Although conversation did pick up especially when we started talking about you.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Me? Why were you talking about me?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: My friends were inquisitive. They wanted to know more about you. They would ask me questions like: Is she married or single? Who does she like better shy guys or outgoing guys? Does she like tall guys or short guys?  Does she prefer Coke or Pepsi?", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le16ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "56000", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Haha. I'm a Pepsi girl.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: Well, I was completely embarrassed because I couldn't answer any of their questions; and I wish I could. You see, I like you Vanessa, and I would like to get to know you better.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>:   Bill, are you asking me out on a date?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: Even better, I'm asking you to come to the Maldives with me.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: You must be joking!\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>:  Why? How long have we known each other?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: We've known each other for about a year.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: Do we get along well?", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "85500", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Yes.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: Do we like one another?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Yes.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: So? What is the trouble?\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: It is extremely short notice for one thing. The other is I manage your Bistro. Who would run the place if I'm gone? I almost fired someone tonight. This is not the best time to go traipsing around the world.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: It's the perfect time! The staff will be just fine. You don't have to stay away for an extended absence. Just for a nice little getaway. You deserve a break and I'll take care of everything.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: But Bill, we are just friends.\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Bill</span>: Friends go on vacation together, don't they? Sun and sand or a frigid Boston winter?  I'm leaving at the end of the week so you have sometime to think it over.  Besides, didn't you once tell me you loved to be spontaneous?   Goodnight!\n</br><span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Vanessa</span>: Goodnight, Bill.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le16ob04re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le16ob04re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}